## Get in touch

Have a question about Allmaps, an idea to share or a project you'd like to
discuss? [Send us an email](mailto:hello@allmaps.org).

## Join the conversation

Find us in the **#allmaps** channel on [IIIF Slack](https://iiif.io/community/).
The [IIIF Maps Community Group](https://iiif.io/community/groups/maps/) is
another place to meet people working with maps and IIIF.

## Report a problem

Found a bug or have a feature request?
[Open an issue on GitHub](https://github.com/allmaps/allmaps/issues).
Include the tool you're using and the steps to reproduce the problem.

## Support Allmaps

Read about the [IIIF Partnership](/iiif-partnership) to learn how IIIF
Consortium members can support the project.
